@startuml
title 小組加入、即時作答檢視與學習單匯入 - Component
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Teacher
rectangle "Quiz Buzzer" {
  component "React Activity UI" as UI
  component "Guided Notes Import" as Importer
  component "Activity / Group Services" as Activity
  component "Buzzer Flow / Progress Query" as Buzzer
  component "SQLite Repositories" as DB
  component "Authenticated WebSocket + Presence Monitor" as Live
  component "Feature 004 Result Review" as Results
}
Teacher --> UI : import / edit, open joining, view roster/progress
Student --> UI : join / reconnect / answer
UI --> Importer : import or replace before joining opens
Importer --> DB : validate and atomically save complete question set
UI --> Activity : explicit open-joining action / join / recovery
Activity --> DB : phase, readiness, opening marker, presence, roster
Activity --> Live : publish committed phase/roster revisions
UI --> Buzzer : submit / request teacher question progress
Buzzer --> DB : valid answer, rank, per-question progress
Buzzer --> Live : publish committed teacher/team answer state
Live --> UI : role-scoped roster (including full state) and answer updates
UI --> UI : keep existing student team-formation display
Student --> Results : ended read-only result review if authorized
Teacher --> Results : ended result review
@enduml
